sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Workspace UI
  participant V as Validation and permission layer
  participant API as Server mutation boundary
  participant DB as Tenant-scoped database
  participant A as Audit and notification layer
  User->>UI: Entry and open form
  UI-->>User: Form with required fields and context
  User->>UI: Submit
  UI->>V: Validate fields, role, tenant, totals, dependencies
  alt Invalid input or insufficient authority
    V-->>UI: Field errors or permission explanation
    UI-->>User: Error state with correction path
  else Valid request
    V->>UI: Confirmation summary
    User->>UI: Confirm action
    UI->>API: Submit mutation
    API->>DB: Persist tenant-scoped record
    DB-->>API: Confirmed row or server error
    alt Database error
      API-->>UI: Error with retry and draft preservation
      UI-->>User: Actionable failure state
    else Confirmed
      API->>A: Append audit event and trigger notification if needed
      A-->>API: Evidence/notification result
      API-->>UI: Confirmed record and result state
      UI-->>User: Success and linked result
    end
  end
